sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Reviewer
  participant S as Static site
  participant A as App shell and state
  participant T as Token state
  participant E as Markdown editor
  U->>S: open mardoc.app
  S-->>A: static files from out/
  A->>A: start in demo mode with mock files and PRs
  A->>T: read mardoc_github_token
  T-->>A: no saved token
  U->>A: choose a sample document
  A->>E: mock document content
  E-->>U: rendered document
